      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* ─── Values ─── */}
  <section class="py-24 border-t border-white/5">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-14">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-indigo-400 mb-3">What we believe</p>
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white">Three principles, written into the architecture.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        {/* Ownership */}
        <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-7">
          <p class="text-base font-semibold text-white mb-3">Your knowledge belongs to you.</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Customer-specific knowledge stays in your organization's partition — your deliverables, your meetings, your decisions, your edits. The platform itself improves over time by learning structural patterns, and we're transparent about exactly what's learned and how: anonymized only, stripped of names, companies, projects, and locations before any cross-customer use. Enterprise deployments can opt out entirely. Open exports. Full provenance on every claim. No black boxes.
          </p>
        </div>

        {/* Efficiency */}
        <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-7">
          <p class="text-base font-semibold text-white mb-3">Efficiency is a byproduct, not a north star.</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Hyphos makes teams faster and clearer — that part is real, and we'll measure it with you. But it isn't what we optimize for. We optimize for what produces those outcomes durably: people doing meaningful work at sustainable pace, juniors growing into seniors through the work itself. Efficiency follows from that.
          </p>
        </div>

        {/* No profiling */}
        <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-7">
          <p class="text-base font-semibold text-white mb-3">People are not the product.</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            The platform records what people <em>did, decided, and committed to</em> — never how they <em>are</em>. No tone analysis. No morale dashboards. No psychological profiling. Knowledge of people is role, contribution, and authority — never personality.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
